---
import TextPage from '../layouts/TextPage.astro';
---
<TextPage
	title="Contact eCamx"
	description="How to reach eCamx — removal requests, copyright notices, corrections and general questions."
	heading="Contact"
>
	<p>
		eCamx has no contact form, because a static site has nowhere to send it.
		Email works and gets read.
	</p>

	<h2>One address: <a href="mailto:info@ecamx.com">info@ecamx.com</a></h2>
	<p>
		Everything goes to the same inbox. Put the reason in the subject line so it
		gets to the right place quickly:
	</p>
	<ul>
		<li>
			<strong>REMOVAL</strong> — you broadcast on a platform we index and do not
			want to appear here. Write from an address connected to that account and
			we will exclude you. No explanation needed.
		</li>
		<li>
			<strong>DMCA</strong> — copyright notice, following the
			<a href="/dmca/">DMCA procedure</a>.
		</li>
		<li>
			<strong>URGENT</strong> — illegal content or a suspected minor. We remove
			first and ask questions afterwards. Please also report it to the hosting
			platform, which is named on every listing.
		</li>
		<li>
			<strong>PRIVACY</strong> — data access, correction or deletion requests.
		</li>
	</ul>

	<h2>Before you write about a wrong listing</h2>
	<p>
		Listing data comes straight from the platforms' own feeds and is rebuilt
		daily. If a model's age, country, or tags look wrong here, they are almost
		certainly wrong on the source profile too — correcting them there will fix
		them here on the next rebuild.
	</p>
</TextPage>
